test_mode
"test-mode is running. Put unit in middle to get rich fast"
End

team_aan
"Host enabled Team modus: Do NOT click 'surrender' now,  or your teammate will be booted from the game! \n 
 Sell CC or self destruct if you want to quit.\n
 (do not enable team modus in FFA games, it will slow things down)"  
End


SCRIPT: instructions
"=> The goal of this map is to collect as much money as you can. The more money you have, the better units will spawn for you. \n
=> You can collect money by 1: Killing enemy units (cashbountry is enabled) 2: Putting a unit in the middle 3: Picking up crates. \n
=> To win the game kill your enemy's base or gattling canon But be aware: those buildings do have extra hitpoints! \n
=> The gattling canon is not a normal gattling cannon. And it cannot detect stealth units! \n 
=> As long as your barracks and armsdealer are not destroyed,these building will spawn free units(more money = better units).\n
=> In your store (the island behind your base) you can use hijackers or saboteurs to buy extra units, upgrades or defenses.
The number of flags behind the hut indicate the 'price' of the unit. Example: To buy a Raptor, put just 2 hijackers in the hut next to Raptor \n 
=> Every $500 you collect(so at $500, $1000, $1500 etc...) an extra hijacker will spawn in your store.  Every $1500 a saboteur will spawn in your store.\n
=> When the casino timer expires, a casino will spawn in your store (& a free hijacker). Put 1 hijacker in it to win a prize.  \n 
=> Hero units spawn at certain cash milestones. [CIA agent, UN Soldier, Militiatank, UN humvee, Alpha Auroa, Nuketruck] \n 
=> You can self-destruct bij selling the middle patriot EMP on your store island! \n
=> Every 60 seconds a money crate or bonus unit will spawn in the middle of the map! \n
"
End


